{
  "name": "Aspiramaq-Docs-Manager",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📂 GESTÃO DE DOCUMENTOS DO RAG\n\n**GET /aspiramaq-docs-list** → lista todos os documentos (metadados + nº de chunks).\n\n**POST /aspiramaq-docs-delete** `{ \"ids\": [\"...\"] }` → remove do banco (vetores, rows, metadados) e do Google Drive.\n\nO reprocesso fica no workflow **Aspiramaq-RAG** (webhook `aspiramaq-docs-reprocess`), pois reutiliza o pipeline de extração/embedding.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-d0c500000d01",
      "name": "Sticky Note Docs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-208, -160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "aspiramaq-docs-list",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4000-8000-d0c500000d02",
      "name": "Listar Docs Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [272, -64],
      "webhookId": "7f3d9a10-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-d0c511570001"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
